# The paper. Kept on this machine as the specification the port is written
# against, and deliberately not committed: arXiv 2602.09845 is distributed
# under arXiv's non-exclusive licence, which grants arXiv the right to
# distribute it and grants us none. Fetch it with
# `curl -O https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.09845v1` and the source bundle from
# `https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.09845`. Quoting a section, an equation and a
# sentence in a docstring is citation and stays; a wholesale copy would not be.
arXiv-2602.09845v1/
2602.09845v1.pdf
